2.8],"facing":"down","says":"Gate stays open till dusk. Keep your blade sheathed in town."},{"id":"guard2","role":"Gate guard","post":[102.4,838.4],"facing":"up","says":"Papers? No, we don't do papers here. Just don't start anything."},{"id":"guard3","role":"Guard","post":[1075.2,556.8],"facing":"left","says":"Move along. Nothing to see in the square but cabbages and gossip."},{"id":"guard4","role":"Guard","post":[601.6,902.4],"facing":"right","says":"The Lady pays us to stand here. So I stand here."},{"id":"guard5","role":"Guard","post":[1331.2,569.6],"facing":"down","says":"The healer's busy enough without you starting fights."},{"id":"guard6","role":"Guard","post":[1382.4,684.8],"facing":"right","says":"The hermit lives over the creek. Odd fellow. Harmless, mostly."},{"id":"guard7","role":"Guard","post":[710.4,1235.2],"facing":"down","says":"Nobody crosses till the river drops. Ferryman's orders. Well, mine."},{"id":"guard8","role":"Guard","post":[1113.6,211.2],"facing":"right","says":"Captain wants the graves watched, nights too. Don't ask me why. I didn't."},{"id":"guard9","role":"Watchman","wander":[96,704,1408,784.0],"says":"Keep the peace, and the peace keeps you.","lamp":"carried"},{"id":"guard10","role":"Watchman","wander":[592.0,560.0,1072.0,912.0],"says":"Mind your purse in the square. Not everyone here is honest.","lamp":"carried"},{"id":"guard11","role":"Watchman","wander":[544,1168.0,1280,1232.0],"says":"Seen anything odd up the river? Tell the warden at the gate.","lamp":"carried"},{"id":"wren","role":"Thief","post":[204.8,636.8],"facing":"down","says":["Oh! You startled me. Sorry. I'm Wren.","I've been sitting by this gate three days now, watching who comes and goes.","There's work waiting for me in Stonebridge, a few days down the river road. Honest work. Mostly.","But the road's crawling with bandits since the bridge washed out, and the wolves are bold enough to take a drover's cattle.","One elf with a dagger doesn't get far out there alone. I've tried. Twice.","Two of us, though? That's a different story. I'm quick, I'm quiet, and there's no lock in the Riverlands I can't open."],"ask":{"q":"So... are you heading that way? Will you let me come with you?","yes":["Really? Ha! You won't regret it, I promise.","Let me fetch my pack. When you set out for Stonebridge, I'll be right behind you."],"no":["Ah. Well, I can't blame you. The road's dangerous enough without strangers.","If you change your mind, I'll be here by the gate. Probably."]}},{"id":"stablehand","role":"Stablehand","post":[364.8,1013.12],"facing":"down","says":"Horses? Not for sale. The bridge at Stonebridge washed out, so they're all spoken for.","night":"away","via":"riverhold-inn"},{"id":"ferryman","role":"Ferryman","post":[784.0,1427.2],"facing":"down","says":"No crossing today. River's high, and something's been knocking at the hull.","night":"away","via":"riverhold-inn"},{"id":"lurker","role":"Hooded stranger","post":[524.8,236.8],"facing":"left","says":"You didn't see me. I didn't see you. That's how it works back here."},{"id":"gravedigger","role":"Gravedigger","post":[1235.2,214.4],"facing":"up","says":"Seven graves since spring. Most from up the river. Nobody says why.","night":"away","via":"riverhold-inn"},{"id":"fisher","role":"Fisherwoman","post":[1776.0,1235.2],"facing":"down","says":"The pike are biting. So's something bigger, down by the old mill.","night":"away","via":"riverhold-inn"},{"id":"noble","role":"Lady of Riverhold","post":[947.2,556.8],"facing":"down","says":"Riverhold pays its dues to Castle Dunmere, and Dunmere forgets us all the same.","night":"away","via":"riverhold-gablecottage"},{"id":"wanderer1","role":"Townsman","wander":[592.0,560.0,1072.0,912.0],"night":"away","via":"riverhold-inn"},{"id":"wanderer2","role":"Townswoman","wander":[592.0,560.0,1072.0,912.0],"night":"away","via":"riverhold-house2"},{"id":"wanderer3","role":"Pilgrim","wander":[96,704,1408,784.0],"night":"away","via":"riverhold-inn"},{"id":"wanderer